---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';

const updated = 'September 1, 2026';
const prose =
  'mt-12 max-w-3xl text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft [&_h2]:mt-12 [&_h2]:font-display [&_h2]:text-2xl [&_h2]:tracking-tight [&_h2]:text-ink [&_p]:mt-5 [&_ul]:mt-5 [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:space-y-2 [&_ul]:pl-5 [&_a]:underline';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy policy"
  description={`How ${site.name} collects, uses and stores the information you submit through this website.`}
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Privacy', href: '/privacy' }]}
>
  <section class="shell pt-32 md:pt-44">
    <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
    <h1 class="mt-6 text-[clamp(2.25rem,5vw,3.75rem)] leading-[1]">Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-muted">Last updated {updated}</p>

    <div class={prose}>
      <p>
        This policy describes exactly what this website collects. It is written to match how the site actually works —
        if you find something here that does not match reality, email
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> and we will correct it.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>Only two things:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>What you type into a form.</strong> The contact, valuation, listing enquiry and buyer alert forms ask
          for your name, email address, phone number and whatever details you choose to include — for valuations, that
          includes the property address, size, bedroom and bathroom count and condition.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Anonymous usage statistics.</strong> Page views, referring site, approximate country, device type,
          scroll depth and which buttons are clicked. These are aggregate counts. They are not tied to your name or
          email, and we cannot use them to identify you.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We do not buy data about you, we do not run advertising pixels, and we do not attempt to match your form
        submission to your browsing behaviour.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        This site sets no advertising or tracking cookies, which is why you are not being asked to dismiss a cookie
        banner. Our analytics counts visits without storing a cookie or a persistent identifier on your device. If the
        firm later enables a cookie-based analytics product, this page and a consent notice will be updated before it
        goes live.
      </p>

      <h2>How your information is used</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To reply to your enquiry, which is normally a phone call, text or email from a broker.</li>
        <li>To prepare the valuation or property information you asked for.</li>
        <li>To meet record-keeping obligations that apply to licensed real estate brokerages in North Carolina.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We do not sell your information, and we do not share it with lead-generation networks. Contractors who help us
        deliver the service — our form provider, email host and customer relationship system — process it on our behalf
        under their own agreements and may not use it for anything else.
      </p>

      <h2>Marketing messages</h2>
      <p>
        If you ask for property alerts, you get property alerts. You will not be added to a drip sequence you did not
        request. Every message includes a way to stop, and replying STOP to a text or asking by email ends it
        immediately.
      </p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        Enquiries that do not become clients are deleted after 24 months. Transaction records are retained for three
        years after closing, as required by the North Carolina Real Estate Commission.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask us what we hold about you, ask for it to be corrected, or ask for it to be deleted, by emailing
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. We respond within 30 days. If you are covered by the GDPR or
        a US state privacy law that grants additional rights, we honour those rights regardless of where you live.
      </p>

      <h2>Security</h2>
      <p>
        The site is served over HTTPS only. Form submissions are transmitted encrypted to our form provider and
        forwarded to a mailbox on our own domain. No payment information is ever collected through this website.
      </p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>This site is not directed at children under 13 and we do not knowingly collect their information.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        {site.legalName}, {site.address.street}, {site.address.city}, {site.address.region} {site.address.postalCode}.
        <br />
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> · <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="pb-24"></div>
</Base>
